error[SC0411]: `q` may be read before anything was assigned to it
   ╭─[ an_escape_on_one_arm_and_a_shared_allocation_on_the_other.c:8:5 ]
   │
 8 │     free(q);
   │     ───┬───  
   │        ╰───── not assigned on every path here
